OL,3,GNEWSAColdest autumn night leaves West  
OL,4,AMidlands sparkling with frost          
OL,6,FBlankets of frost transformed parts of 
OL,7,Fthe West Midlands into a winter-like   
OL,8,Flandscape after the coldest night of   
OL,9,Fautumn so far.                         
OL,11,FFrom glittering fields and frozen      
OL,12,Fleaves to sheep making full use of     
OL,13,Ftheir woolly coats, photographers      
OL,14,Facross the region captured the beauty  
OL,15,Fof a chilly start to the weekend.      
OL,17,FImages shared with BBC Weather Watchers
OL,18,Fcame from across Wolverhampton,        
OL,19,FHerefordshire, Shropshire and          
OL,20,FStaffordshire as temperatures plunged  
OL,21,Fovernight.                             
OL,23,APub: 21-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2 
