OL,3,GNEWSAColdest autumn night leaves West  
OL,4,AMidlands sparkling with frost          
OL,6,FThe Met Office said the weekend ahead  
OL,7,Fwould stay cold but bright, with crisp 
OL,8,Fmornings and sunny spells for many.    
